{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2019-10-09 22:30:00', 'title': 'PG&E PROVIDES UPDATES ON PUBLIC SAFETY POWER SHUTOFF', 'text': 'OCT 10  - PG&E CORP <PCG.N>::PG&E PROVIDES UPDATES ON PUBLIC SAFETY POWER SHUTOFF.SECOND PHASE OF SHUTOFFS HAS BEGUN FOR 234,000 CUSTOMERS IN SIERRA FOOTHILLS AND BAY AREA.50,000 CUSTOMERS ALREADY RESTORED FROM FIRST PHASE OF SAFETY SHUTOFFS.SAFETY INSPECTIONS IN SOME AREAS OF HUMBOLDT HAVE STARTED.POTENTIAL CUSTOMER IMPACTS IN KERN COUNTY REDUCED FROM 43,000 TO APPROXIMATELY 4,000.A THIRD PHASE OF SAFETY SHUTOFFS IS BEING CONSIDERED FOR PORTIONS OF KERN COUNTY.'}